# Each window gets random test data in its session data (koan_session_data.h),
# to check it comes back after restarts and with a reopened window.
--koan-test-window-data
# The test_helper extension: on macOS askTestHelper() in lib/mac.mjs pins the
# Essential (the tab's menu is a native NSMenu there; {root} is the repo,
# suite.sh expands it).
--load-extension={root}/scripts/e2e/extensions/test_helper
